      {
        "id": 223858,
        "name": "Missingno",
        "username": "Missingno",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/missingno/{size}/2049_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-11-01T03:29:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Near-Mint, and considering I was forced to play<strong> the complete opposite of my playstyle</strong> I'm not gonna count that as a streak breaker.&nbsp; The rewind button is probably going to file abuse charges as well since I save-scummed with both Argent Edgedept and Vis like a madman for the best possible plays.&nbsp; Protip, after you get Unhallowed Halls out, ignore the enviroment and just mill Writhe's damagers.</p>\n<p>Also try to focus down Biomancer if you can.&nbsp; If he gets two homoculi out, you're done for.&nbsp; Writhe at 2 HP and last man standing for me.</p>",
