        "created_at": "2018-11-01T17:17:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Gods, that was ugly. Fine at 3/0/2 on my third try, and I think Bugbear would have won on his turn (with 1 HP) if I hadn't used Writhe's \"use a power\" incap to let AA use Scherzo of Frost and Flame.</p>",
